# Cloudflare Pages routing for the two "dynamic" routes that static export
# can't pre-render one file per arbitrary game id for (see
# src/app/game/[gameId]/page.tsx and join/[gameId]/page.tsx). Each was built
# as a single placeholder file; this proxies every real id under that path
# to the placeholder with a 200 (the address bar keeps showing the real
# id — this is Cloudflare's documented SPA-fallback pattern, not a
# redirect). The actual id is then read client-side from the real URL.
/game/*   /game/_   200
/join/*   /join/_   200
